&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.innovatorsontap.com/podcast/the-philosophy-of-innovation-w-rajesh-vashist&quot;&gt;Innovation on Top – Philosophies of Innovation with Rajesh Vashist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fabricatedknowledge.com/p/an-interview-with-rajesh-vashist-3e0#details&quot;&gt;Fabrication Knowledge – An Interview with Rajesh Vashist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/user/sitimecorp/videos&quot;&gt;SiTime Corporation – YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
